        "body": "Adobe is a for-profit public company founded in 1982 and headquartered in San Jose, CA. Its stock trades under the ticker ADBE, and its most recent annual filing (a 10-K) reported revenue of $23,769,000,000 for the period ending November 28, 2025. The company's website, focused on Adobe Express, describes it as an all-in-one design, photo, and video tool intended to make content creation easy, with uses including social content, videos, and logos.\n\nAdobe tracks several AI products across design, video, and audio categories. Adobe Express AI is described as a lightweight design tool with quick content creation capabilities and integration with Adobe Firefly, which is the company's image generation model. Both are characterized on the site as trained on commercially safe data. Premiere Pro AI covers professional video editing with features including generative extend and color match, also with a commercial-safe training claim. Adobe Podcast AI provides audio enhancement including speech enhancement and microphone check, again with a commercial-safe training claim. The site additionally references an AI Assistant 2 within Adobe Express that allows users to prompt, create, and edit content while editing individual layers.\n\nThe held facts associate Adobe with 175 instances of legal exposure in California, though no specific cases are recorded in the available data. Adobe has a presence in the site's registry with CIK number 0000796343 on file.",
